"P1280039214" "The Family isn't the only group who thinks everything and everyone on Striga is theirs to take. The Council's been running press gangs lately, and a lot of good citizens have gone missing. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to take to the streets and see if you can put the hurt on the Council's press gangs.</a> Maybe you can even find out where to go looking for the missing men."
