"P2421047939" "I've got a task for you, {HeroName}, if you're willing. I need you to get to the Bog and clear a path down to the swampy region, through the Banished Pantheon and the Council War Wolves. I don't expect it to be easy. But heroes like you need access to the Bog if you're ever going to clear the Council out. What do you say? <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you clear a path through the Pantheon and the Council?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P4206471017" "Clear a path through the Pantheon and the Council"
