// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1364432083" "I wonder if you'd be willing to help me with something kind of personal. You see, after years of searching, I've finally located somebody who hurt me very badly. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I've located his lab, and all I need you to do is go in and arrest him.</a> {HeroName}, make sure he doesn't hurt anybody else."
// AcceptString :
"P3087627286" "Arrest the man who experimented on Jack"
// SendOffString :
"P1396436440" "You want the whole ugly story? Well, ok. You see, I was injured in a squall back in '67. My shipmates brought me to a new doctor on the island, a man known as Dr. Goldsmith. If we'd only known! Goldsmith was in league with a shadowy group that later materialized as the Council. He did gruesome experiments on me for months before I escaped. To tell you the truth, I haven't been the same since."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3532114608" "Arrest Dr. Goldsmith & his guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3569185577" "If you could arrest Dr. Goldsmith, it might finally help me come to terms with my past."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1064552740" "This secret lab is well-stocked and state of the art."

